'''Nuvian''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{Zone|Dragontail}} that sells [[Abiphone]]s. 

== Location ==
'''Nuvian''' is located within a room in the {{Zone|Dragontail}} brewery, on the [[Crimson Isle]]. They can only be accessed through a Keypad located at {{Coords|-678|107|-736}}, which requires a 4-digit code. 
The code can be obtained by overhearing {{NPCSprite|Nall}} and {{NPCSprite|Kutral}} talk through the window of the brewery, same building as the Keypad, at {{Coords|-655|107|-741}}. Overhearing the conversation requires being beside the window, not directly in front of it, as well as standing still and crouching. The code changes every real life day.
