== Trivia ==
*'''Nuvian's''' shop UI is titled Abiphone Shop, while most other vendors, including their [[Udel|Mage Faction counterpart]], have their own name.
**'''Nuvian''' used to sell [[Abiphones]] for {{Green|1.5%}} more than their original prices offered by [[Udel]]; however, when [[Abiphones & Co.]] released, the prices were reduced to normal.

